OL,3,GNEWSAPlea to give Thames seals space
OL,4,Afor everyone's safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarmalade the harbour seal was a
OL,7,Ffamiliar visitor to the River Thames,
OL,8,Foften popping up at Greenwich and
OL,9,FRotherhithe in south-east London.
OL,11,FShe was given her nickname because of
OL,12,Fher bright golden-coloured coat.
OL,14,FHowever, as the number of seal
OL,15,Fsightings along the river increases,
OL,16,Fcharity Thames Seal Watch has urged
OL,17,Fmembers of the public to give the
OL,18,Fanimals space.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
